icy</a></li></ul></li><li class='menu_2' id='menu_2'><a href='/content/lp-pricing' >LP Pricing</a></li><li class='menu_4' id='menu_4'><a href='/content/main-office' >Main Office</a></li><li class='menu_5' id='menu_5'><a href='/content/cenex-c-store' >Cenex C-Store</a></li><li class='menu_6' id='menu_6'><a href='/contact-us.php' >Contact Sparta Coop</a></li><li class='menu_15' id='menu_15'><a href='/content/untitled' ></a></li><li class='menu_16' id='menu_16'><a href='/content/unclaimed-property' >Unclaimed Property</a></li></ul>                    </section>\n                </nav>\n\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class='row hero-img'><div class='small-12 columns'><div><img src='/uploads/grain[4].jpg' alt='Grain Prices' title='Grain Prices'></div></div></div>\n        <div class=\"row\">\n            <div class=\"large-12 columns\">\n                <div id='main_content_area' class='non_index_page  page-content-grain-fertilizer-grain-prices2'>\n\n\n                    <div id='breadcrumbs-greeting' class='hide-for-print'>\n                        <div class='row'>\n                            <!-- <div class='columns medium-6 small-12 medium-push-6 medium-text-right'> -->\n                            <div class='columns medium-6 small-12'>\n                                <div class='bread_crumbs'><a href='/content/grain-fertilizer' >Grain &amp; Fertilizer</a><a href='/content/grain-fertilizer/grain-prices2' class='current'>Grain Prices</a></div>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <!-- <div class='medium-6 small-12 medium-pull-6 columns'> -->\n                            <div class='medium-6 small-12 columns medium-text-right'>\n                                <a href='/login.php'>Login</a>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n\n                    </div>\n\n\n                            <div class='cms_entry '>\n                            <h1>Grain Prices</h1>\n                        <div class='cms_content'>\n                <div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"large-8 columns\">\n<p>All grain priced as delivered to Sparta Coop Grain facility at 325&nbsp;Hemstock Drive off South Water Street in Sparta.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>All grain is priced&nbsp;based on the&nbsp;&quot;Cash Price&quot;&nbsp;live quotes displayed on this website fed by DTN. Sometimes, the DTN service has problems and glitches that cause prices to be displayed inaccurately. Therefore, please always call to verify prices. &nbsp;Moreover, sometimes the cash bid display does not temporarily display prices at all (especially at the beginning of a week or month). A grain transaction isn&#39;t done until we have agreed on a price and delivery date. We reserve the right to quote a fair price based on the actual value and not on the website display.</p>\n\n<p>Call - <a href=\"tel:608-269-5201\">608-269-5201</a></p>\n\n<p><strong><a href=\"http://www.morningagclips.com/articles/wisconsin/\">Click for Daily Wisconsin Agri-News</a></strong></p>\n\n<p><strong><a href=\"http://www.news8000.com/weather\">Click for WKBT LaCrosse Weather</a></strong></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"large-4 columns\"><picture><source height=\"\" srcset=\"/i/1778713315000/x970-vwebp/uploads/content_files/images/2014%20Mag%20004.JPG\" type=\"image/webp\" width=\"\" /><source height=\"\" srcset=\"/i/1778713315000/x970/uploads/content_files/images/2014%20Mag%20004.JPG\" type=\"image/jpeg\" width=\"\" /><img alt=\"Sparta Coop Grain Prices\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/i/1778713315000/x970/uploads/content_files/images/2014%20Mag%20004.JPG\" style=\"margin-top: 5px;margin-bottom: 5px;\" title=\"Sparta Coop Grain Prices\" /></picture></div>\n</div>\n\n<p><div id='cash-bids-table-widget'></div>\n<script src='https://content-packages.dtn.com/ui-widgets/cash-bids-table-widget/cash-bids-table-widget-1.0-latest.js'></script>\n\n<script>\n    window.dtn.cashBids.createCashBidsTableWidget({\n\n\n        \"apiKey\": \"<redacted>\",\n        \"container\": \"#cash-bids-table-widget\",\n        \"siteId\": \"e0356301\",\n        \"groupBy\": \"LOCATION\",\n        \"showGroupByOptions\": true,\n        \"view\": \"DETAIL\",\n        \"showViewOptions\": true,\n        \"showLocationsSelect\": true,\n        \"showCommoditiesSelect\": true,\n        \"defaultLocation\": {\n            \"locationName\": \"Main\"\n        },\n        \"hideCommodities\": [\n            \"Canola\"\n        ],\n        \"hideLocations\": [\n            \"Canada\"\n        ],\n        \"deliveryDateFormat\": \"DELIVERY_LABEL\",\n        \"visibleFields\": [\n            \"DELIVERY_END\",\n            \"CASH_PRICE\",\n            \"BASIS_PRICE\",\n            \"SYMBOL\",\n            \"FUTURES_QUOTE\",\n            \"FUTURES_CHANGE\"\n        ]\n\n\n    });\n</script></p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- footer here -->\n<footer>\n    <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"large-12 columns\">\n            <div class=\"footer\">\n                <p align=\"center\" class=\"footer\">Sparta Co-op Services | Main Office & LP, 325 Hemstock Drive, Sparta, WI 54656 | Email: <a href=\"mailto:spartaco@spartacoop.com\" class=\"footer\">spartaco@spartacoop.com</a><br>\n                    <a href=\"http://www.webteam.net/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"footer\">Website Development by Webteam, Inc.</a>\n                </p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</footer>\n\n\n<script src=\"/js/foundation.min.js\"></script>\n<script>\n    $(document).foundation({\n        equalizer: {\n            equalize_on_stack: true\n        }\n    });\n</script>\n\n<script type='text/javascript' language='JavaScript'>\n    $(document).ready(function() {\n        $(\"input[type='date']\").each(function() {\n\n            if (!Modernizr.inputtypes.date) {\n                var options = {\n                    changeMonth: true,\n                    changeYear: true,\n            